You should have a AWS account and configure aws CLI.


Create EKS cluster IAM Role:

AWS service ---> EKS ---> EKS cluster --->
policy name - AmazonEKSClusterPolicy
role name - EKS-Devops-project-1

once role created, add the below policy:
AmazonEKSVPCResourceController

Create Node Group IAM Role:

AWS service --> EC2 --> 

ADD below policies:

AmazonEC2ContainerRegistryReadOnly
AmazonEKS_CNI_Policy
AmazonEKSWorkerNodePolicy

Create role. ---> name - EKS-Devops-Project-EKS-Noderole
